{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e16-scene-03",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "让他好好安静休息  (Strict Rest and Guarding the Sickroom)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After Chun Yuqiao's doctor agrees to monitor him inside the office under strict quiet, Bu Xiaogu takes charge outside the sickroom, keeps work away from him, and gently clears up a visitor's misunderstanding. Listen to Bu Xiaogu in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "等一下，我们明天有直播。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我刚才其实想说的是，病情该如何医治，我们全听您的安排。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "医疗设备，还有出诊费用什么的，没有任何问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "任何工作上的事情，都不要来麻烦淳于，自己处理吧，让他好好安静休息。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你别误会，你真误会了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "知道辛惠美在哪儿吗？我就是想让你找到辛惠美，这样以后有人照顾淳于总。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总的药可能要输光了，我去看一眼。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢你。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "等一下，我们明天有直播。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait a moment—we have a live broadcast tomorrow.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我刚才其实想说的是，病情该如何医治，我们全听您的安排。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What I really meant just now is that we will follow your instructions completely on how to treat his condition.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "医疗设备，还有出诊费用什么的，没有任何问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Medical equipment, house-call fees, and everything else will not be any problem at all.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "任何工作上的事情，都不要来麻烦淳于，自己处理吧，让他好好安静休息。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not trouble Chun Yuqiao with any work matters—handle them yourselves and let him rest in peace and quiet.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你别误会，你真误会了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please do not misunderstand—you really have the wrong idea.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "知道辛惠美在哪儿吗？我就是想让你找到辛惠美，这样以后有人照顾淳于总。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you know where Xin Huimei is? I just hoped you could find Xin Huimei so someone can look after Mr Chun Yuqiao.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总的药可能要输光了，我去看一眼。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun Yuqiao's intravenous drip may be running out—let me go check on it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "等一下，我们明天有直播。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我刚才其实想说的是，病情该如何医治，我们全听您的安排。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "医疗设备，还有出诊费用什么的，没有任何问题。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "任何工作上的事情，都不要来麻烦淳于，自己处理吧，让他好好安静休息。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你别误会，你真误会了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "知道辛惠美在哪儿吗？我就是想让你找到辛惠美，这样以后有人照顾淳于总。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总的药可能要输光了，我去看一眼。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢你。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Keeping anxious callers and visitors at bay, Bu Xiaogu returns inside to watch over Chun Yuqiao's recovery. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
